*Always ensure integrity and authenticity of the evidence*

Legal hold: implementation of measures to preserve potential evidence

chain of custody: documenting the chronological history from evidence. When collected -> presented in court

Acquisition: Gathering and collecting digital evidence from various sources. 

Reporting: creation of comprehensive reports from digital forensic investigations

Preservation: Ensuring integrity and authenticity of evidence

E-discovery: identify, collect, and prepare electronically stored Information (ESI) for legal proceedings/investigations


